g the `TERM` environment variable.\r\nFinally, the dependencies have been updated, making more upstream `textual` themes available.\r\n \r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/kainctl/isd/compare/v0.6.1...v0.6.2\r\n","reactions":{"total_count":10,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":2,"eyes":1}}
